## Technical Implementation Details

### Pin Connections (ESP32 to PCM5102A)
```
GPIO22 → LCK (Word Select)
GPIO25 → BCK (Bit Clock)  
GPIO26 → DIN (Data Input)
5V → VCC, GND → GND
```

### Key Classes and Methods
```cpp
class SpotifyPipeline {
    // Lifecycle
    esp_err_t initialize();
    esp_err_t start();
    esp_err_t stop();
    
    // Control
    void setVolume(uint8_t volume);
    bool isPlaying() const;
    
    // Internal
    void handleSpotifyCommand(const cspot::DeviceStateHandler::Command& command);
    bool isWifiConnected();  // Non-intrusive WiFi check
};
```

### Command Handling
Supports all Spotify Connect commands:
- PLAY/PAUSE/STOP
- SKIP_NEXT/SKIP_PREV
- VOLUME control
- SEEK positioning
- SHUFFLE/REPEAT modes
- Track information
- Connection management

### WiFi Management Strategy
- **External Management**: WiFi connectivity handled by main application
- **Status Validation**: Pipeline checks WiFi status before connecting to Spotify
- **No Duplication**: No WiFi setup/management code in Spotify pipeline
- **Clean Separation**: `ctx->session->connectWithRandomAp()` connects to Spotify servers, NOT WiFi

