## Known Considerations

### Memory Usage
- CSpot library uses significant RAM
- Bell audio framework requires heap space
- Monitor stack usage in main task

### Timing
- Network connectivity required for operation
- Authentication process takes 2-3 seconds
- Buffer audio appropriately for smooth playback

### Security
- Uses official Spotify Connect protocol
- Authentication handled by Spotify
- No credential storage required

